    - target: {fileID: 6557113022658846402, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[1].subtitleText
      value: To retrieve the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> on the table, you must
        stretch your hand outward and use the <color=#FFFFFF>[SELECT]</color> button
        to grab it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6557113022658846402, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[2].subtitleText
      value: Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> into the empty slot on your
        left hand to enable teleportation.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6557113022658846402, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].subtitleText
      value: Teleport to the adjacent room and place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color>
        into the pedestal to begin the tutorial puzzle.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6557113022658846402, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[5].subtitleText
      value: The fusebox needs <color=#FFFFFF>three fuses</color> to power on the
        light in the factory. Grab and insert the fuses and pull the <color=#FFFFFF>lever</color>
        to turn on the light.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
